## LLaDA-V integration

`relay_cache/lladav/model/` contains inference components adapted from
[LLaDA-V](https://github.com/ML-GSAI/LLaDA-V) and LLaVA. The original Apache-2.0
headers of Haotian Liu, Zebin You, EleutherAI and the Hugging Face team are
retained. Imports have been relocated and unused training, competing samplers,
vision backends and task heads omitted. The SigLip component retains its
upstream attribution to the MILVLG/imp vision encoder. The visual decoder uses
Relay's existing cache policy and execution components; image processing and
native first-pass cache initialization follow the historical visual run.

Visual query formatters and answer-extraction/normalization templates in
`dllm-eval/dllm_eval/vendor/` are adapted from the MathVista and MathVerse
evaluators bundled by LLaDA-V. Thanks to the authors of both benchmarks and
their evaluation tools. The API adapter uses DeepSeek Flash, so the released
visual numbers are proxy-judge results, not the benchmarks' official GPT-4o
scores. Model weights, images, questions, answer keys and judge responses are
not redistributed in this repository.
